 "code": "make_freeze_add_v04.py",
 "reason": "AMENDMENT_12 s3c (IMM2) and s3b (B2 re-track of the new runs): code, constants, tuning outputs, P-bar, section text and second programs, frozen before LOCK_A12a and before any IMM2 value on an evaluation run. Tuning (20 lead-braking tuning runs only): identity check of the phase-restricted NIS statistic (all phases = frozen run_stat, bit for bit); kq (pre frames) no sign change, window unreachable, kept as a note (IMM2_TUNE_KQ_v01.json, medians copied from the search log); coordinator 00:18 option (b): kappa_q = kappa of record 0.16788; sa2rec (braking frames) sigma2_hi = 0.9172759353897799, median 1.9969, 20 runs, window reached. Constants out/imm2t/IMM2_CONSTANTS_REC_v01.json. P-bar_IMM2 on the 120 tuning runs (120/120, counts 20,611/2,159) out/pbar/PBAR_IMM2_v01.json. Code: b_imm2_tune_v01, b_imm2_kq_note_v01, b_imm2_v01 (P-bar, C and new re-track, gated on LOCK_A12a), b_l12_ids_v01 (CD's l12 run-id rule), b_l12_retrack_v01 (B2 for Y, manifests), b_fresh_analysis_v04 (IMM2 on C/new, one-sided p; test-old B1 89/89 identical to v01), b_modeprob_v01, b_fresh_export_v05, b_export_b12x_v01, b_imm2_checks_v01, b_imm2_twin_v01 (byte-identical copies of CD's Y-L12 programs, recorded below as external), make_freeze_add_v04 (this tool). Second programs (Claude Sonnet 5.5, from the section text): recount_fresh/imm2_v04.py (old-run test as IMM at K=2000: 26/26 keys identical, 2,000 rows bit-equal), recount_fresh/modeprob2_v01.py (old-run B1 test: 21/21 identical to b_modeprob_v01). Second IMM (imm2_v02) with IMM2 constants on old run 0012: ids identical, P9 rel 2.6e-14. Section text B_retrack/A12_3c_IMM2_v02.md (v01 is the superseded draft). No library change.",
